OL,3,GNEWSATeen jailed for #20 debt murder to
OL,4,Aremain unnamed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe identity of a teenager who murdered
OL,7,Fa 16-year-old boy over a #20 cannabis
OL,8,Fdebt must remain anonymous, a judge has
OL,9,Fruled.
OL,11,FThe teenager, who was automatically
OL,12,Fgranted anonymity during his trial
OL,13,Fbecause of his age, attacked Joshua
OL,14,FIngram, from Newhaven, with a 19cm (7.5
OL,15,Finch) combat-style knife at Seaford
OL,16,Frailway station in East Sussex on 10
OL,17,FSeptember, 2025.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
