OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATeen jailed for #20 debt murder to
OL,4,Aremain unnamed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe judge at his trial at Hove Crown
OL,7,FCourt, Mr Justice Bourne KC, said he
OL,8,Fhad adopted a "fake gangster
OL,9,Fpersonality" before carrying out the
OL,10,Fattack. He was jailed for a minimum of
OL,11,F14 years earlier this month.
OL,13,FAt a hearing on Monday the same judge
OL,14,Fruled that naming Joshua's killer, now
OL,15,F17, "may disrupt the momentum" of his
OL,16,Frehabilitation.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
